# Regenerable capture output, two kinds:
#   mm_laptop_*.png — deterministic Blender frames; regenerate with
#     tools/device-render/laptop.py or copy from ui-demo/public/.
#   mm_home / mm_dashboard / mm_org / mm_tasks / mm_badges_* — Playwright
#     page captures from the e2e demo suite; re-run it to recreate them.
# A hand-authored asset that happens to start with mm_ needs an explicit
# negation below, or it will be silently skipped.
public/mm_*.png
